OL,3,GNEWSAVisually impaired athletes secure
OL,4,Abronze in Italy
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo baseball players have hit home-runs
OL,7,Ffor Team GB's blind team and brought a
OL,8,Fbronze medal back to Teesside.
OL,10,FGareth Mallabar, 29, and Grant Hammond,
OL,11,F47, from Hartlepool are part of the
OL,12,FTeam GB Blind baseball squad and
OL,13,Fcompeted in the Blind Baseball
OL,14,FInternational Cup in Italy.
OL,16,FThe side played alongside countries
OL,17,Fincluding Italy, Cuba, the USA, Czechia
OL,18,Fand Chinese Taipei before reaching the
OL,19,Fsemi-finals and securing a medal.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,393,390,260,160,0,100
