OL,3,GNEWSAVisually impaired athletes secure
OL,4,Abronze in Italy
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey both said they felt "very proud
OL,7,Fand ecstatic" to be able to get a medal
OL,8,Fin a very intense competition.
